(15862, 800838, 'Fairness', 'Privacy and security', 'Inclusiveness', 'Transparency', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 4, 'N', 'N', 'People should understand how and why an AI system made a decision', 'AI systems should treat all people fairly and avoid unjust bias', 'AI systems should protect personal data and be resilient to misuse', 'AI systems should empower and engage people of all abilities and backgrounds', 4, 1, 2, 3),
