(9, 539, 3, 1, 3, 4, 4, NULL, 'Took Exams,Checked Results,Enrolled Course,Used Mobile,Timer issues,Confusing UI', 'Overall, the application provides a clean and intuitive interface that is easy to navigate. The exam review section is particularly well designed, as it clearly highlights the correct and incorrect answers along with detailed explanations, making it easy to understand mistakes and learn from them. The overall user experience is smooth, and the application has a solid foundation.', 'There are a few areas that could enhance the overall user experience:\r\n\r\nIncrease or properly handle the exam session timeout so users do not lose their progress during longer exams.\r\nFix the phone number validation issue when the country code (+91) is automatically added.\r\nImprove the exam navigation by replacing the arrow-only controls with clearly labeled Next and Previous buttons.\r\nMake the Stack layout truly vertical so it is visually different from the default layout.\r\nAdd a proper Back button on the payment/course page to return to Browse & Enroll.\r\nFix the Subject filter so it correctly displays subject-specific content.\r\nUpdate exam statuses correctly after an attempt (e.g., change from Pending to Completed while still showing remaining attempts, if any).\r\nEnsure the Completed and Recent Results sections display only attempted exams, while assigned exams remain under Upcoming Exams.\r\nFix the Instructions navigation so it opens the selected exam\'s instructions instead of redirecting to another page.\r\nKeep users within the Videos section when clearing search filters instead of redirecting them to All Resources.', 'Add a proper Back button on pages such as the payment/course details page for easier navigation.\r\nImprove the exam navigation by using clearly labeled Next and Previous buttons instead of arrow-only controls.\r\nAutomatically move attempted exams to the Completed section while still displaying remaining attempts, if applicable.\r\nAllow users to bookmark or mark questions for review during exams.\r\nAdd a progress indicator showing the number of answered, unanswered, and flagged questions.\r\nImprove filter functionality across Browse & Enroll and Study Resources for a smoother user experience.\r\nProvide an option to resume an exam if the session expires unexpectedly or due to network interruptions.\r\nConsider adding a dark mode and keyboard shortcuts for better accessibility during long study sessions.\r\n\r\nOverall, the application is easy to use and has a clean interface. The exam review with answer explanations is especially useful. Addressing the current bugs and refining the navigation would make the platform even more reliable and user-friendly.\r\n\r\nAs this is testing \r\nIn User perspective UI should be improved :)', 'No', 'STDNT', NULL, '2409:40f0:6055:5819:c1ab:d736:f787:7fc5', '2026-08-02 13:06:03'),
(10, 425, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Took Exams,No issues', 'good', 'no', '', 'Yes', 'STDNT', 1, '2401:4900:97b5:2689:2d0c:d6aa:a61f:ed4c', '2026-08-14 08:33:54'),
(11, 2205, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 5, 'Took Exams', '', '', '', 'Yes', 'STDNT', NULL, '2409:40f0:6413:612b:8000::', '2026-08-18 13:57:26');
