(2, 481, 'Dr.SudhaD', 'I have received the Ph.D. degree in Computer Science and Engineering\r\nfrom the National\r\nInstitute of Technology Warangal, India. I am currently working as an Associate Professor in Kakatiya\r\nInstitute of Technology and Science, Warangal, India. My research interests include network function virtualization, AI enabled networks, and network optimization. I have teaching expertise in academic courses such as computer networks (CN), advanced data structures (ADS) and design and analysis of algorithms (DAA).', 'PhD', '1.5 years', 0, 'images/teachers/teacher_1781168998_c3f39515.jpg', 'Y', '2026-06-11 09:09:58', '2026-06-12 03:41:12'),
